OL,3,AVote counting under way in the Holborn
OL,4,Aand St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBallots are being counted in the
OL,7,FHolborn and St Pancras by-election,
OL,8,Fwith the result expected to be declared
OL,9,Fin the early hours of Friday
OL,11,FThe north London seat became vacant
OL,12,Fafter former Prime Minister Keir
OL,13,FStarmer announced he was standing down
OL,14,Ffrom the House of Commons last month
OL,16,FThis by-election is a test of whether
OL,17,Fthe Labour Party under Burnham's
OL,18,Fleadership can beat the Green Party on
OL,19,Fits left, writes our correspondent -
OL,20,Fhere's a reminder of who is running for
OL,21,FLabour and the Greens
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
