OL,3,AVote counting under way in the Holborn
OL,4,Aand St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolborn and St Pancras is a
OL,7,Fconstituency full of well-known London
OL,8,Flandmarks, and just under half of
OL,9,Fresidents are aged under-30 - these are
OL,10,Fthe areas covered by the consituency
OL,12,FFifteen candidates are standing in the
OL,13,Fby-election - you can read a full list
OL,14,Fhere
